From: Paul Zander <negril.nx+gentoo@gmail.com>

remove redundant Find*.cmake files
use CMake 3.20 GTest targets for nanovdb
change vdb_ax_test WORKING_DIRECTORY so testfiles can be found
fix syntax for OpenVDBCXX.cmake

Rebased from openvdb-13.0.0-cmake_fixes.patch onto 14.0.0.  The
OpenVDBCXX.cmake and vdb_ax_test hunks needed only new offsets.  Two hunks
had to be re-cut:
- CMakeLists.txt: 14.0.0 dropped FindBlosc/FindLog4cplus from
  OPENVDB_CMAKE_MODULES and added FindZstd, so the context changed.
- nanovdb unittest: 14.0.0 inserted a CUDA header-check block above the GTest
  guard and grew the GTest consumers from 4 to 9 (blosc, cuda_memory_resource,
  cuda_util, cuda_util_sync, cuda_buffer), all renamed here.

All four changes were re-verified as still needed against the 14.0.0 tarball;
none of them was fixed upstream.
